    {
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Closing in favor of the root-cause fix in Megatron-LM: https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/pull/7613 (NVIDIA/Megatron-LM#7613), which sums the GatedDeltaNet `out_norm` gradient across TP when sequence parallelism is off. Once that is merged, these recipes are correct with or without SP, so forcing SP here and guarding it with a test is no longer needed.",
